    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa9 BOXKING \ud83d\udc51 - Bounce the box! Become the king!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but 100% addictive! \ud83d\ude80 One click of the mouse and the box will bounce and avoid obstacles and fly to the target point~! \ud83c\udfaf But don't let your guard down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae How to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Click the mouse to bounce the box!\u2705 Avoid obstacles such as solid walls, wooden boxes, flames, and skulls! \ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udd25\u2705 When you reach the target point, GO to the next level! \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Coin &amp; Ruby System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Collect coins during the game to upgrade your ability to get more coins and rubies!\ud83d\udc8e Collect coins and rubies to buy colorful box skins and play more stylishly! \ud83c\udfa8\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Why should you play BOXKING?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Simple but fun to play!\u2714\ufe0f Increasingly difficult levels stimulate your desire for challenge!\u2714\ufe0f Cute box customization to show off your own personality! \ud83c\udfad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? Bounce the boxes, avoid obstacles, collect coins, and become the king! \ud83d\udc51</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 BOXKING \u2013 Challenge now! \ud83c\udfc6</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa9 BOXKING \ud83d\udc51 - Bounce the box! Become the king!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but 100% addictive! \ud83d\ude80 One click of the mouse and the box will bounce and avoid obstacles and fly to the target point~! \ud83c\udfaf But don't let your guard down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae How to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Click the mouse to bounce the box!\u2705 Avoid obstacles such as solid walls, wooden boxes, flames, and skulls! \ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udd25\u2705 When you reach the target point, GO to the next level! \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Coin &amp; Ruby System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Collect coins during the game to upgrade your ability to get more coins and rubies!\ud83d\udc8e Collect coins and rubies to buy colorful box skins and play more stylishly! \ud83c\udfa8\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Why should you play BOXKING?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Simple but fun to play!\u2714\ufe0f Increasingly difficult levels stimulate your desire for challenge!\u2714\ufe0f Cute box customization to show off your own personality! \ud83c\udfad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? Bounce the boxes, avoid obstacles, collect coins, and become the king! \ud83d\udc51</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 BOXKING \u2013 Challenge now! \ud83c\udfc6</p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83c\udfa9 BOXKING \ud83d\udc51 - Bounce the box to the target point! Bounce the box by clicking the mouse, avoid obstacles, and reach the target to advance to the next level! \ud83d\ude80 Collect coins and rubies to upgrade, and enjoy stylish play with unique box skins! \ud83c\udfa8\u2728 \ud83d\udce6 Try BOXKING right now! \ud83c\udfc6",
